      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Build and manage Connected Apps in one place",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/connected-apps-one-place/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.445Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We’re launching a Connected Apps Platform to give developers a single place to build and manage apps for Search and the Gemini app.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/connected-apps-one-place/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.445Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Plus, we’re rolling out a new set of Connected Apps from partners like Adobe, Calm, and Peloton.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/connected-apps-one-place/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.445Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To help users get more done, today we’re launching the preview of our Connected Apps Platform, a unified way for more app developers to bring their capabilities directly into Gemini and Search.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/connected-apps-one-place/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.445Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We’re also rolling out a new set of Connected Apps partners to give people even more ways to streamline their day.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/connected-apps-one-place/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.445Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Connected Apps Platform gives developers the opportunity to build once and reach high-intent users across both Search and the Gemini app.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/connected-apps-one-place/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.445Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We’ve launched more than 50 Connected Apps between Search and Gemini in areas ranging from productivity and event ticketing to health and fitness.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/connected-apps-one-place/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.445Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Integrations with partners like Adobe, Experian, Localiza, and Peloton are live for users in Gemini, and in the coming weeks, we’ll be bringing these Connected Apps to Search as well.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/connected-apps-one-place/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
